  "visual": {
    "visualType": "textbox",
    "objects": {
      "general": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "HOW TO READ THIS PAGE",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1A9E8F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "5pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "What it shows",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "When revenue counts as earned under IFRS 15. Two rules apply here:",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Over time (PRJ-101, PRJ-102): earned gradually as work is done.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Point in time (PRJ-103): earned when QA releases a batch (see page 5).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "5pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "How it is calculated (over time)",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "% complete = cost to date ÷ EAC",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Revenue to date = price × % complete",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Revenue in month = this month's revenue to date − last month's",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "EAC = estimate at completion, the latest forecast of total cost.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "5pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Try this",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• PRJ-101: price 1.0M, EAC 800k. In May cost to date is 600k → 600 ÷ 800 = 75% → revenue to date 750k. Check the table row by row.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Switch to PRJ-102 and look at June: cost jumps but revenue barely moves. The EAC rose from 1.5M to 1.8M, so % complete fell: a cumulative catch-up.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• October on PRJ-102: a 300k change order raised the price to 2.3M.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "5pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Say it in one line",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "\"Revenue follows delivery. For long projects I measure progress with cost-to-cost, so estimate changes flow straight into the month they happen.\"",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
